# Acceptance Criteria

This chapter is complete when:

- The enterprise Operational Excellence framework and operating model are fully documented.
- SRE, DevSecOps, Platform Engineering, GitOps, FinOps and AIOps capabilities are defined.
- Incident management, capacity planning, automation, disaster recovery and continuous improvement processes are established.
- Repository organization, operational assets, architectural principles and traceability are complete.
- The EVOXA Operational Excellence framework provides a resilient, efficient and continuously optimized operational foundation for the entire Data Platform.

---

# Key Takeaways

- Operational Excellence ensures the EVOXA Data Platform is not only scalable but also reliable, secure and cost-efficient throughout its lifecycle.
- SRE, DevSecOps, GitOps, FinOps and AIOps work together to automate operations, reduce risk and continuously improve platform performance.
- Comprehensive observability, automation and operational governance enable rapid incident resolution and proactive optimization.
- This Operational Excellence framework establishes the operational backbone required to sustain enterprise-grade analytics, AI and data services at scale.

---

